close_reason: "Replaced the pre-tag next-version assertion with tag-context gates after exact tag/package equality; tag audit, lint, secret history, build, 625 unit tests, package smoke, pack inspection, and Actionlint pass."
body: "The first production tag run reached publication validation, but the pre-tag version rule interpreted the newly created tag as requiring the next same-day ordinal. The Release workflow already verifies exact tag/package equality and should run the remaining release gates without the pre-tag next-version assertion."
